      `<svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 8h7l-7 8h7'/><path d='M14 4h5l-5 5h5'/></svg>`
